WEBVTT

00:20:29.577 --> 00:20:35.069
And how do you think that affects
how the market is behaving right now,

00:20:35.093 --> 00:20:40.179
how it's going to recover
over the next, you know, few years,

00:20:40.203 --> 00:20:42.218
as the economy recovers?

00:20:45.393 --> 00:20:49.029
RD: The basic fundamentals

00:20:49.053 --> 00:20:54.609
of money credit crisis,

00:20:54.633 --> 00:20:57.164
who has what income,

00:20:57.188 --> 00:20:58.363
who has what expenses,

00:20:58.387 --> 00:21:00.649
who has what balance sheet,